Fool me, that's all the hero I need be

01:01:47.340 --> 01:01:50.980
I smile to think of you and me

01:01:50.980 --> 01:01:58.540
You and I

01:02:01.920 --> 01:02:04.800
And how all pleasure makes you cry.

01:02:12.130 --> 01:02:21.670
When the world has got me down, and I've almost lost the will to try.

01:02:24.960 --> 01:02:28.960
I may look sad, and I may frown.

01:02:30.570 --> 01:02:38.710
But I still find comfort in your waiting, your hello, your goodbye.

01:03:00.670 --> 01:03:06.190
And I pretend that I don't know how you've been watching me.

01:03:06.780 --> 01:03:15.900
All the time that I lay sleeping, but nothing that lingers in your eyes.

01:03:25.690 --> 01:03:29.600
That's all the hero I need be.

01:03:32.520 --> 01:03:49.980
I start to think of you and me, that makes me cry

01:04:15.260 --> 01:04:16.780
Before me

01:04:30.030 --> 01:04:58.030
Thank you. I want to remind you that your host next week will be Paul Anka.

01:04:58.360 --> 01:04:59.640
You've been a lovely audience.

01:05:00.000 --> 01:05:02.300
And if you're watching at home, sleep warm.

01:05:02.580 --> 01:05:04.000
If you're not, drive carefully.

01:05:04.300 --> 01:05:05.540
God bless and good morning.
